<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Blesson Convent High School Tundri</title>
<style>
*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
}
body{
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f5f7fb;
  color:#222;
}
header{
  background:#082b63;
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:15px;
}
.header-logo{
  width:80px;
  height:80px;
  border-radius:50%;
  object-fit:cover;
  background:white;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
header h1{
  font-size:25px;
}
header p{
  color:#ffd700;
  margin-top:5px;
}
nav{
  margin-top:15px;
}
nav a{
  color:white;
  text-decoration:none;
  margin:8px;
  font-size:14px;
}
nav a:hover{
  color:#ffd700;
}
.hero{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#061c43,#0b3d91);
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:60px 20px;
}
.full-logo{
  width:300px;
  max-width:80%;
  border-radius:50%;
  border:5px solid #ffd700;
  background:white;
  box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
}
.hero h2{
  font-size:36px;
  margin-top:20px;
}
.hero p{
  margin:15px;
  font-size:18px;
}
.btn{
  display:inline-block;
  background:#ffd700;
  color:#111;
  text-decoration:none;
  padding:12px 20px;
  border-radius:7px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:5px;
}
section{
  padding:55px 8%;
}
.title{
  text-align:center;
  color:#082b63;
  margin-bottom:30px;
  font-size:30px;
}
.grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
  gap:20px;
}
.card{
  background:white;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}
.card h3{
  color:#082b63;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.blue-section{
  background:#eaf0ff;
}
form{
  max-width:600px;
  margin:auto;
  background:white;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}
input,select,textarea{
  width:100%;
  padding:12px;
  margin:8px 0;
  border:1px solid #ccc;
  border-radius:6px;
}
textarea{
  height:100px;
}
button{
  border:none;
  cursor:pointer;
}
.notice{
  background:white;
  max-width:800px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:12px;
}
.notice p{
  padding:10px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;
}
.contact{
  max-width:800px;
  margin:auto;
  background:white;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:12px;
}
footer{
  background:#061c43;
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:25px;
}
.footer-logo{
  width:90px;
  height:90px;
  object-fit:cover;
  border-radius:50%;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  header h1{
    font-size:20px;
  }
  .hero h2{
    font-size:27px;
  }
  .full-logo{
    width:220px;
  }
  nav a{
    display:inline-block;
    margin:5px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<img src="school-logo.jpg"
class="header-logo"
alt="Blesson Convent High School Logo">
<h1>BLESSON CONVENT HIGH SCHOOL</h1>
<p>TUNDRI • SARANGARH-BILAIGARH • CHHATTISGARH</p>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#academics">Academics</a>
<a href="#admission">Admission</a>
<a href="#teachers">Teachers</a>
<a href="#notice">Notices</a>
<a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
<a href="#events">Events</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<img src="school-logo.jpg"
class="full-logo"
alt="Full School Logo">
<h2>Welcome to Blesson Convent High School</h2>
<p>Education • Knowledge • Discipline • Success</p>
<p>
Classes Available: Nursery, LKG, UKG to 10th Standard
</p>
<a href="#admission" class="btn">
Admission Inquiry
</a>
<a href="#contact" class="btn">
Contact School
</a>
</section>
<section id="about">
<h2 class="title">About the School</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>
Blesson Convent High School, Tundri is committed to providing
quality education and helping students develop knowledge,
confidence, discipline and good values.
</p>
<br>
<h3>Principal's Message</h3>
<p><b>Mrs. Rajani Azad</b></p>
<br>
<p>
Education helps every child learn, grow and become a responsible citizen.
</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="blue-section" id="academics">
<h2 class="title">Classes & Academics</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>🌱 Nursery</h3>
<p>Early childhood education.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>📘 LKG & UKG</h3>
<p>Strong learning foundation.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>📚 Primary School</h3>
<p>Quality academic education.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🎓 Up to Class 10</h3>
<p>High school education.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="admission">
<h2 class="title">Online Admission Inquiry</h2>
<form onsubmit="submitForm(event)">
<input type="text"
placeholder="Student Name"
required>
<input type="text"
placeholder="Parent / Guardian Name"
required>
<input type="tel"
placeholder="Mobile Number"
required>
<select required>
<option value="">
Select Class
</option>
<option>Nursery</option>
<option>LKG</option>
<option>UKG</option>
<option>Class 1</option>
<option>Class 2</option>
<option>Class 3</option>
<option>Class 4</option>
<option>Class 5</option>
<option>Class 6</option>
<option>Class 7</option>
<option>Class 8</option>
<option>Class 9</option>
<option>Class 10</option>
</select>
<textarea
placeholder="Message">
</textarea>
<button class="btn" type="submit">
Submit Inquiry
</button>
<p id="message"></p>
</form>
</section>
<section class="blue-section" id="teachers">
<h2 class="title">Teachers & Staff</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>👨‍🏫 Principal</h3>
<p>Mrs. Rajani Azad</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>👩‍🏫 Teachers</h3>
<p>Teacher information can be added here.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🏫 School Staff</h3>
<p>Staff details can be added later.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="notice">
<h2 class="title">Notice Board</h2>
<div class="notice">
<p>📢 Admissions are open for Nursery to 10th Standard.</p>
<p>📢 Parents can contact the school for admission information.</p>
<p>📢 Important school announcements will appear here.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="blue-section" id="gallery">
<h2 class="title">Photo Gallery</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
📸 School Photos Coming Soon
</div>
<div class="card">
🏆 Student Activities Coming Soon
</div>
<div class="card">
🎉 School Events Coming Soon
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="events">
<h2 class="title">Events Section</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>📅 Upcoming Events</h3>
<p>School events will be announced here.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🎉 Activities</h3>
<p>Cultural, academic and sports activities.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="blue-section">
<h2 class="title">School & Student Login</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>🏫 School Login</h3>
<input type="text"
placeholder="School User ID">
<input type="password"
placeholder="Password">
<button class="btn">
Login
</button>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🎓 Student Login</h3>
<input type="text"
placeholder="Student ID">
<input type="password"
placeholder="Password">
<button class="btn">
Login
</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section>
<h2 class="title">UDISE+ & Online Fee Payment</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>🏛️ UDISE+ Number</h3>
<p>
Official UDISE+ Number will be added here.
</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>💳 Online Fee Payment</h3>
<p>
Online payment gateway can be connected later.
</p>
<button class="btn">
Pay Fees
</button>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🔐 Admin Panel</h3>
<p>
Admin panel can manage students, teachers,
admissions, notices and school information.
</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
